#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:5
#: 4b999c769f3c4e2095853909ab44c97c
msgid "Mission Planner Initial SETUP"
msgstr "Mission Planner 初始 SETUP"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:6
#: 0ef4916484484b79aa0b1b020a64d38a
msgid ""
"This section of Mission Planner, invoked by the Menu item  ``SETUP`` at the "
"top of Mission Planner, has several subsections. The subsections are where "
"you set up and configure your autopilot to prepare it for your particular "
"vehicle. Typically these sections are \"must do\" actions that are required "
"before first flight."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 顶部菜单项 ``SETUP`` "
"进入的此部分包含多个子菜单，用于配置飞控以适配您的特定飞行器。这些部分通常是首次飞行前必须完成的操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:8
#: a468d90586984e3cb1f840a7f05920d7
msgid ""
"What you see when you enter this section depends on whether or not you are "
"connected. Each menu item will bring up a new screen, each is discussed "
"below with links to more detail."
msgstr "进入此部分后所见内容取决于是否已连接飞控。每个菜单项将打开一个新页面，以下分别说明并提供详细链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:13
#: 44158164af174a89bae34a969f245010
msgid "Install Firmware"
msgstr "安装固件"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:14
#: 8ba3f6ff37354f968e7c007bcd4a9c33
msgid ""
"You will see this menu item if the autopilot is both connected or not; "
"however, this menu will only be functional when disconnected. If you have a "
"new autopilot or if you want to update the control software that resides in "
"your autopilot, you must install (upload) the :ref:`firmware <common-"
"glossary>` into it."
msgstr ""
"无论飞控是否已连接，均可见此菜单项；但该菜单仅在断开连接时可用。若您有新飞控，或需要更新飞控中的控制软件，必须将 :ref:`固件 <common-"
"glossary>` 安装（上传）到飞控中。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:16
#: 3310e76b1d3a4040a37c9ea8a0ad8265
msgid ""
"The firmware is located at `firmware.ardupilot.org "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__. If the autopilot has ArduPilot firmware"
" already installed, you can use this page to upload firmware for different "
"vehicles or versions. See this :ref:`Loading firmware <common-loading-"
"firmware-onto-pixhawk>` page. Otherwise, you must use other methods than "
"Mission Planner for getting ArduPilot installed for the first time, see this"
" :ref:`section<common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards>`."
msgstr ""
"固件位于 `firmware.ardupilot.org <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__。若飞控已安装 "
"ArduPilot 固件，可使用此页面上传适用于不同飞行器或版本的固件，详见 :ref:`加载固件 <common-loading-firmware-"
"onto-pixhawk>` 页面。否则，首次安装 ArduPilot 必须使用 Mission Planner 以外的方法，详见 "
":ref:`此部分<common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:19
#: d9d2021c879246119c793c2535957603
msgid ""
"From this screen you can also select \"All Options\" allowing you to select "
"and load any variation of the firmware, or \"Load custom firmware\", most "
"often used when a developer has trial code to load."
msgstr ""
"在此页面还可选择「All Options」以选择并加载任意固件变体，或选择「Load custom firmware」，通常用于开发者加载测试代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:22
#: fb379151e14847299e8cc5e5fc6f2800
msgid "Install Firmware Legacy"
msgstr "安装旧版固件"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:23
#: b2abc364a59e4ec3a4af22381d636b4a
msgid ""
"Yet another way to load older versions of the firmware. Again, shown only "
"when not connected."
msgstr "另一种加载旧版固件的方式，同样仅在断开连接时显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:26
#: 67fbaa07dd20431eb5cde78d10824414
msgid "Mandatory Hardware"
msgstr "必需硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:27
#: 9498801421654a9da7c584f751ca30cf
msgid ""
"You will only see this menu item if the autopilot is connected. Click this "
"menu item to see the items you must set up before you attempt to operate "
"your vehicle. Specifics are located in the ArduPilot.org documents which "
"cover your specific vehicle (Copter, Plane, Rover, Blimp)."
msgstr ""
"此菜单项仅在飞控已连接时显示。点击此菜单项查看飞行前必须完成配置的项目，具体内容请参阅 ArduPilot.org "
"中针对您所用飞行器（Copter、Plane、Rover、Blimp）的文档。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:32
#: 952cc885cbf84a52bb42d3cca7c78073
msgid "Before operating the vehicle, you must setup:"
msgstr "操作飞行器前，必须完成以下设置："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:34
#: 157a0a43397543e795ce33fa07592a35
msgid ":ref:`Accel Calibration <common-accelerometer-calibration>`"
msgstr ":ref:`加速度计校准 <common-accelerometer-calibration>`"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:35
#: 4681097efd414e17af09304742ead5c9
msgid ""
":ref:`Compass (optional for Plane)<common-compass-calibration-in-mission-"
"planner>`"
msgstr ":ref:`罗盘（Plane 可选）<common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>`"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:36
#: dba5f3c35b4b46ae9e1c0653de02e68d
msgid ":ref:`Radio Calibration<common-radio-control-calibration>`"
msgstr ":ref:`遥控校准<common-radio-control-calibration>`"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:37
#: f2396d2e68bf49b0b5bf24e21e175b87
msgid ""
"Servo Output : configure each :ref:`output's function<common-rcoutput-"
"mapping>`. Default values get loaded upon initial firmware installation, but"
" be sure to check them here."
msgstr ""
"舵机输出：配置每个 :ref:`输出的功能<common-rcoutput-mapping>`。初始固件安装时会加载默认值，请务必在此处确认。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:38
#: 205c078d179b452aba668aaf6f1f1302
msgid ""
":ref:`ESC Calibration<esc-calibration>` for Copter only (not required for "
"ESCs running DShot protocol, but must be :ref:`configured <common-brushless-"
"escs>` in ArduPilot) Plane and Rover use their own :ref:`common-esc-"
"calibration` technique, but is also a mandatory setup item."
msgstr ""
"仅 Copter 需要 :ref:`ESC 校准<esc-calibration>` （使用 DShot 协议的 ESC 无需校准，但必须在 "
"ArduPilot 中进行 :ref:`配置 <common-brushless-escs>`）。Plane 和 Rover 使用各自的 "
":ref:`common-esc-calibration` 方法，同样是必须完成的设置项。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:39
#: 0822dc75cf3b4c3b83c8f7f267b794b7
msgid ""
"Flight Modes: Refer to :ref:`Plane <plane:flight-modes>`, :ref:`Copter "
"<copter:flight-modes>` or :ref:`Rover<rover-control-modes>` mode pages."
msgstr ""
"飞行模式：请参阅 :ref:`Plane <plane:flight-modes>`、:ref:`Copter <copter:flight-"
"modes>` 或 :ref:`Rover<rover-control-modes>` 的模式页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:40
#: 426661739d2b4f8f91ca584f444ae54e
msgid ""
"Failsafe: Refer to :ref:`Plane <apms-failsafe-function>`, :ref:`Copter "
"<failsafe-landing-page>` or :ref:`Rover<rover-failsafes>` failsafe pages."
msgstr ""
"失控保护：请参阅 :ref:`Plane <apms-failsafe-function>`、:ref:`Copter <failsafe-"
"landing-page>` 或 :ref:`Rover<rover-failsafes>` 的失控保护页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:43
#: 08225fa3fe224815a13a663366df504a
msgid "Optional Hardware"
msgstr "可选硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:44
#: e50a8c904ebe43daa386fcb1cbe412ab
msgid ""
"This submenu allows the configuration of optional devices, many of which can"
" be configured while Mission Planner is unconnected. Programming of the Sik"
"  Telemetry Radio, UAVCAN setup, PX4 Optical Flow sensor, and Antenna "
"Tracker can be done here, as well as the setup of a :ref:`joystick <common-"
"joystick>` to be used in conjunction with Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"此子菜单用于配置可选设备，其中许多设备可在 Mission Planner 未连接时完成配置。可在此处对 Sik 数传电台、UAVCAN 设置、PX4 "
"光流传感器和 AntennaTracker 进行编程，以及设置与 Mission Planner 配合使用的 :ref:`摇杆 <common-"
"joystick>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:46
#: f01b585918b346fcba5289f0e01331d4
msgid ""
"When connected, peripherals such as Battery Monitors, Integrated OSD, "
"Airspeed Sensors, and Rangefinders can be configured. Also, this submenu has"
" a Motor Test function allowing you to test the direction and order of "
"Copter and QuadPlane Motors."
msgstr ""
"已连接时，可配置电池监测器、集成 OSD、空速传感器和测距仪等外设。此外，此子菜单还提供电机测试功能，可测试 Copter 和 QuadPlane "
"电机的转向和顺序。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:51
#: 5fcf54dc49a94bffb842817f05ebe0d2
msgid "DroneCAN/UAVCAN SLCAN"
msgstr "DroneCAN/UAVCAN SLCAN"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:52
#: 0bfc09897a474e75a1098eee7843590e
msgid ""
"The SLCAN tool inside Mission Planner allows viewing, configuration, and "
"software updates of DroneCAN nodes connected to the CAN bus port of the "
"autopilot. There are two ways to connect to the DroneCAN node:"
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 内置的 SLCAN 工具允许查看、配置并更新连接到飞控 CAN 总线端口的 DroneCAN 节点固件。连接 "
"DroneCAN 节点有两种方式："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:54
#: c7b71ad7bc1a4668b0764078fb7e26cf
msgid "Using SLCAN directly"
msgstr "直接使用 SLCAN"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:55
#: b77ac4b4e33f4dd78a7189f3212ede31
msgid "Using SLCAN over MAVLink"
msgstr "通过 MAVLink 使用 SLCAN"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:58
#: ed248e5e8ed9447494880e64a62e4476
msgid "Connecting to the DroneCAN node"
msgstr "连接到 DroneCAN 节点"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:60
#: 6af18d24395f4e1ca5e97cd55cd4e26f
msgid ""
"If using the direct SLCAN connection method, autopilot parameters have to be"
" configured first. See :ref:`common-slcan-f4` or :ref:`common-slcan-f7h7` "
"for setup information. Mission Planner should be in the disconnected state, "
"and make sure the SLCAN port is shown as the selected COM port in the "
"dropdown box in the upper right corner of Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"若使用直连 SLCAN 方式，需先配置飞控参数，详见 :ref:`common-slcan-f4` 或 :ref:`common-"
"slcan-f7h7`。Mission Planner 应处于断开状态，并确保 Mission Planner 右上角下拉框中显示 SLCAN "
"端口作为所选 COM 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:62
#: c760502343ff4c229fb2118ff33587f2
msgid ""
"If using the MAVLink method, nothing is required for setup and Mission "
"Planner should be in the connected state via the normal MAVLink connection "
"to the autopilot."
msgstr "若使用 MAVLink 方式，无需额外设置，Mission Planner 应通过正常的 MAVLink 连接处于已连接状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:64
#: 9ce6ac363b634c368391e4a8003da368
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner, navigate to Initial Setup->Optional "
"Hardware->DroneCAN/UAVCAN click on the highlighted red button if connecting "
"using the direct SLCAN method, or the appropriate green button for MAVLink "
"communication over either CAN bus port 1 or port 2, depending on which port "
"the node is attached."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 中，导航至「Initial Setup」->「Optional "
"Hardware」->「DroneCAN/UAVCAN」，若使用直连 SLCAN 方式，点击红色高亮按钮；若使用 MAVLink "
"通信方式，则根据节点所接的 CAN 总线端口（端口 1 或端口 2），点击对应的绿色按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:68
#: b6ef9a3112f6465aacff81976fc40365
msgid ""
"The autopilot will connect to Mission Planner using SLCAN, the window will "
"populate with DroneCAN nodes connected."
msgstr "飞控将通过 SLCAN 连接到 Mission Planner，窗口中将列出已连接的 DroneCAN 节点。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:72
#: 1635afabecb44f2b9d2d8f40031a022c
msgid ""
"If the node has a bootloader only installed, then the firmware will need to "
"be uploaded. ``MAINTENANCE`` will be displayed. Click on update firmware. "
"Firmware can be found `here <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/>`__ "
"and downloaded for the node."
msgstr ""
"若节点仅安装了引导程序，则需上传固件，此时将显示 ``MAINTENANCE``。点击更新固件，可在 `此处 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/>`__ 找到并下载适用于该节点的固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:76
#: 2734c2cc77f644449b9306ab8d7ff4bd
msgid ""
"A pop-up will open. Select no and then find firmware for your node "
"previously downloaded and select it."
msgstr "弹出窗口后，选择「否」，然后找到之前下载的节点固件并选择它。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:80
#: 074da01c48b8406688e27a9b4c6de727
msgid ""
"The window will show the firmware being uploaded and a pop-up will show the "
"status."
msgstr "窗口将显示固件上传进度，并通过弹出窗口显示状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:86
#: 4fbd2afa41a74915a4e84f86355ed2ab
msgid ""
"Once complete mode will change to ``OPERATIONAL``. Press the ``Parameters`` "
"button to access node settings. From here DroneCAN device parameters can be "
"accessed or changed."
msgstr ""
"完成后，模式将切换为 ``OPERATIONAL``。点击 ``Parameters`` 按钮进入节点设置，在此可访问或修改 DroneCAN "
"设备参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:90
#: 62725ea4defc4d828cd8c40f3a9046ac
msgid ""
"Clicking on ``Inspector`` will open a popup window to view messages on the "
"CAN bus."
msgstr "点击 ``Inspector`` 将弹出窗口，用于查看 CAN 总线上的消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:94
#: 6a17f474876141b297982e05af2d90c8
msgid ""
"To return to normal Mission Planner operation, change to another tab, and "
"re-connect. You may need to wait 2 seconds before re-connecting."
msgstr "要恢复 Mission Planner 正常操作，切换到其他标签页后重新连接。可能需要等待 2 秒再重新连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:99
#: de674b6186a04724b13108e59538720f
msgid "DroneCAN Firmware Flashing Video"
msgstr "DroneCAN 固件刷写视频"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:104
#: adbaf2ef183b4252b4fd788fa0c122b9
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:105
#: 8478345e562b4a21a32d3322201b9f24
msgid "This section is for advanced users."
msgstr "本部分面向高级用户。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:109
#: b43d61c0dcae454a9825e06d63405199
msgid ""
"Warning Manager: You can create custom warning messages to be displayed on "
"the HUD and in the messages tab of the DATA screen, based on the values of "
"the status items."
msgstr "Warning Manager：可根据状态项的值，创建自定义警告消息，显示在 HUD 及 DATA 画面的消息标签页中。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:110
#: 349175ad3e114ba8a5b7c2b5e345d4e5
msgid ""
"MAVLink Inspector: allows monitoring, real-time, of the various MAVLink "
"status messages being received."
msgstr "MAVLink Inspector：允许实时监控接收到的各种 MAVLink 状态消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:111
#: 8a257e9618144f51a42488ac7b8f401a
msgid "Proximity: View the data from a 360 lidar, if equipped"
msgstr "Proximity：查看 360 激光雷达的数据（如已配备）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:112
#: 9952890dd9134980a72c2201a726e6c9
msgid ""
"Mavlink Signing: This allows you to setup :ref:`secure "
"communications<common-MAVLink2-signing>` with the vehicle."
msgstr "Mavlink Signing：允许设置与飞行器的 :ref:`安全通信<common-MAVLink2-signing>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:113
#: 7900a4b975c04aaeb112d964f560d799
msgid ""
"Mavlink mirror: This allows you to forward the MAVLink traffic to another "
"network-connected location for monitoring. Also see :ref:`MAVProxy "
"Forwarding<mavproxy:mavproxy-forwarding>` for another method."
msgstr ""
"Mavlink mirror：允许将 MAVLink 流量转发到另一网络连接位置以便监控。另见 :ref:`MAVProxy "
"转发<mavproxy:mavproxy-forwarding>` 中的其他方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:114
#: 71b280de4e544c52a03bb7e49c9cfa22
msgid ""
"NMEA: Output the vehicle location as a NMEA GPS string over the network or "
"to a COM port"
msgstr "NMEA：通过网络或 COM 端口以 NMEA GPS 字符串格式输出飞行器位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:115
#: d82e41dc2cd1482d9ad1823f89b362ef
msgid ""
"Follow Me: If using an attached NEMA mode GPS on a COM port to establish the"
" MP GPS location, can send Guided Mode waypoints to the vehicle to follow "
"the GCS."
msgstr ""
"Follow Me：若使用连接到 COM 端口的 NEMA 模式 GPS 建立 MP 的 GPS 位置，可向飞行器发送 Guided "
"模式航点，使飞行器跟随地面站移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:116
#: 281d6de964a94654838e408407746174
msgid ""
"Param Gen: Regenerates Mission Planners parameter list. Occasionally "
"required if new firmware parameters are not being displayed."
msgstr "Param Gen：重新生成 Mission Planner 的参数表，在新固件参数未显示时偶尔需要执行此操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:117
#: faba914222154f26a7b0ce0b76476f8a
msgid ""
"Moving Base: if NMEA GPS is attached to PC, shows PCs location as moving on "
"the map display"
msgstr "Moving Base：若 PC 连接了 NMEA GPS，可在地图显示上以移动方式显示 PC 的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:118
#: 199a5b1f3e114fbba26d723ec02bba9b
msgid ""
"Anon Log: Allows you to hide your location when sharing log files by "
"creating a version with scrambled locations"
msgstr "Anon Log：通过创建位置信息经过混淆处理的版本，在共享日志文件时隐藏您的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-initial-setup.rst:119
#: 7b6cfadcaa9346099d5babfd56a6aa1c
msgid ""
"FFT: Plot an FFT from a log that has IMU batch sampling enabled. See "
":ref:`common-imu-notch-filtering` for an example of its use."
msgstr ""
"FFT：从启用了 IMU 批量采样的日志绘制 FFT 图。使用示例请参见 :ref:`common-imu-notch-filtering`。"
